<section>
<h2 style="padding-bottom:16px">What This Run Did Not Check</h2>
<div class="notchecked">
<div><h3>Format rules</h3><p>This run compared two feeds only. Run shelfcheck check for the OpenAI, ACP, Google and GS1 rules.</p></div>
<div><h3>Probabilistic matching</h3><p>Items were matched on exact keys only: a valid GTIN, or brand, MPN and options. Title similarity is shown as a hint and never decides a match.</p></div>
<div><h3>Whether you will be shown</h3><p>A clean feed is accepted, not promoted. No tool can promise an assistant will show your products.</p></div>
</div>
</section>

